  DisplayName: Pod Hunt
  Description: 'Orcas only - a pod hunt through the Boneyard''s wreckage. Every blast that reaches a
    rival hull is a point: a gunner''s missile, or the bomb''s burst. The guns score
    nothing, but they break the cover a rival hides behind. Take an omni crystal to reload
    every gunner seat, and raise the danger shield when a missile comes for you. First team
    to the target wins.'
